  "note": "The fix commits merge many advisories; only the DelegatingDecompressorFrameListener hunk is this one. Data frames on a stream whose decompressor is closed leak the retained buffer. Http2Decompressor.decompress holds the code in 4.1.130 and 4.2.6 (and grpc-netty-shaded 1.70.0); on 4.1.42 and 4.1.100 (grpc-netty-shaded 1.50.0) it is inline in onDataRead, present in all. Reached only where the app wraps its frame listener in DelegatingDecompressorFrameListener.",
